Browser test fixtures include host styling and images from NTHU CCXP:
Source: https://www.ccxp.nthu.edu.tw/style/PE2.css
The files under test/browser-fixtures/host-assets retain the host's stylesheet
content for offline rendering tests; they are not used by the extension UI.

The bundled jQuery UI 1.10.4 theme retains its upstream license header:
Source: https://www.ccxp.nthu.edu.tw/ccxp/INQUIRE/PE/common/jquery-ui/css/theme/jquery-ui-1.10.4.custom.min.css
License: MIT (https://jquery.org/license)
Copyright: 2014 jQuery Foundation and other contributors

Additional legacy fixture assets are mapped to their original CCXP URL paths in
host-assets.json: login/tree images, Materialize, Kendo UI theme styles and fonts,
Font Awesome, Animate.css, W3.CSS, and notification styles. Existing vendor license
headers are preserved verbatim. These snapshots are test resources only and are
not included in extension packages. Kendo UI assets remain subject to their
upstream Telerik/Progress license; this repository does not relicense them.
